<p>Inflicting pain and death invigorates you.</p><p>Each time you deal a critical strike you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 23, 33, 42, 50</acronym> life (this effect can only happen once per turn).</p><p>Each time you kill a creature you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 23, 33, 42, 50</acronym> life (this effect can only happen once per turn).</p>